---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Terms of Service';
const description =
	'Terms of service for ReferralNowReview.com. This site is for information only. The software is provided by the vendor, not by this website.';
const canonicalURL = new URL('/terms', Astro.site).href;
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonicalURL={canonicalURL} hideCta>
	<article class="legal-page">
		<h1>Terms of Service</h1>
		<p class="updated">Last updated October 23, 2026</p>
		<p>
			These terms cover your use of ReferralNowReview.com. By using the site, you agree to them. If you
			do not agree, do not use the site.
		</p>
		<h2>What this site is</h2>
		<p>
			This website publishes reviews, comparisons, and guides. It is for informational purposes only.
			It is not the checkout, and it is not the software.
		</p>
		<h2>The software belongs to the vendor</h2>
		<p>
			ReferralNow Premium is provided by its vendor. When you buy, you buy from the vendor through their
			checkout, which may be processed on JVZoo. Their terms, refund rules, and product limits apply to
			the software. Ours do not replace theirs.
		</p>
		<p>
			We do not host the app, store your customer list, or pay referral rewards. A 14-day refund, if
			you request one, is handled by the seller under the seller’s refund policy.
		</p>
		<h2>No professional advice</h2>
		<p>
			Nothing on this site is legal, financial, or earnings advice. Examples of ad cost, commissions,
			and competitor prices are illustrations. They can be wrong by the time you read them. You are
			responsible for your own buying decision.
		</p>
		<h2>Affiliate links</h2>
		<p>
			Some links earn us a commission if you buy. That is explained on the
			<a href="/affiliate-disclosure">affiliate disclosure</a>. Using a link is optional.
		</p>
		<h2>Acceptable use</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>Do not attempt to break, scrape in a way that harms, or misrepresent the site.</li>
			<li>Do not copy the pages and present them as your own review.</li>
		</ul>
		<h2>Disclaimer of warranties</h2>
		<p>
			The site is provided as is. We do not warrant that every price, feature, or competitor detail is
			complete or current. The vendor can change the product without notice to us.
		</p>
		<h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
		<p>
			To the fullest extent the law allows, we are not liable for lost profits, lost customers, or
			damages that result from using the site, relying on a page, or buying the software. If a law
			does not allow that limit, our liability is limited to the minimum the law requires.
		</p>
		<h2>Changes</h2>
		<p>We may update these terms. The date at the top will change when we do. Continued use means you accept the update.</p>
		<p>
			Questions: <a href="mailto:contact@referralnowreview.com">contact@referralnowreview.com</a>
		</p>
		<p>
			Related: <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">Affiliate disclosure</a> · <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy policy</a>
		</p>
	</article>
</BaseLayout>
